The records, collections, wantlists, values, prices and covers come from
Discogs (https://www.discogs.com), through its official API
(https://www.discogs.com/developers), used with the personal access token of
each user and under the Discogs API Terms of Use. As those terms ask, the
widgets show "Data provided by Discogs", and the documentation and the README
credit it. The files under test/fixtures are reduced answers of this API, kept
for the tests only.

